  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Man, I hate dodging those wrecking balls! This real estate company\u2019s
      got to go ASAP. "
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Really? They don\u2019t seem that bad to me. I actually think it\u2019s
      great they\u2019re here!"
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Huh?! What\u2019re you talking about? They\u2019re jacking up prices
      and driving everyone away from the Beach."
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I think that\u2019s an improvement. Bringing the property value up.
      Keeping a lot of\u2026 undesirables away.\r"
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'Undesirables? What the &#@$ are you talking about?! '
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Look, all I\u2019m saying is I feel a lot safer at the beach these
      days now that it\u2019s just us pure-skins."
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "It\u2019s literally more dangerous than it\u2019s ever been!"
  - leftSpeaker: Surfer
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
